    "description": "On this tour, you will be able to explore the most romantic places in Paris at night. You will get a chance to ride in style on a sidecar ural by the Arc de Triomphe. Then, you will stop by the world-famous Eiffel Tower. \r\n\r\nYour guide will also take you to the historical site of Les Invalides, housing the Musee de l’Armee, the military museum of the Army of France, the Musee des Plans-Reliefs, the Musee d’Histoire Contemporaine and the Dome des Invalides. \r\n\r\nThe ride will also take you across Saint-Germain-des-Pres, Palais Garnier and other interesting places.",
