            "votes": null,
            "language": "en-gb",
            "isApproved": true,
            "content": "The whole experience of being alone with our guide Michael on a bike gently riding through the Paris traffic seeing the sights was amazing. We stopped by the river opposite the Eiffel Tower just as the lights came on for champagne. So special.",
