                "avatar": null
            },
            "isApproved": true,
            "content": "This was by far the best thing we did in Paris.  We got to see parts of the city we would have never seen.  The guys were great.  The bikes were even better.  It is pricey but SOOOO worth every penny.  We were with our friends and their 13 and 10 year old sons who loved this.  You have to do this tour.  We will do this again next time we are in Paris. Thx is guys so much.   Cheers Regan and Craig!!! ",
